    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Elite Estate Agents are proud to present this fantastic three-bedroom B rated property to the residential sales market. This property is very well proportioned throughout, offering bright and spacious rooms with no compromises, a large patio and garden area to the rear and lots of space to the front with off street parking for 2-3 cars. \n\nThe property is very well located on the Portarlington Road within a short distance of Mountmellick town and its many amenities.\n\nThe Rock, Emo and Portarlington are all within a few minutes drive of 20 Oak Manor. Junction 15 of the M7 motorway is within 10 minutes drive of this property.\n\nViewing is very highly recommended. \n\n\nServices \nOil Central Heating\nSolid Fuel Stove\nMains Electricity and Water "
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall (17.72ft x 6.23ft) Ceramic floor tiles, storage, light fitting <br>Kitchen/Dining Area (15.75ft x 11.48ft) Ceramic floor tiles, fitted kitchen with ample storage options, backsplash tiling, gas hob, oven, dishwasher, patio doors leading to garden, light fittings.<br>Living Room (15.75ft x 11.48ft) Wood effect flooring, feature fireplace with solid fuel stove, light fitting,<br>WC (6.56ft x 3.94ft) Spacious downstairs WC with ceramic floor tiles, hand wash basin, WC, light fitting <br>Master Bedroom (13.78ft x 10.50ft) Very spacious bedroom to the rear of the property; wood effect flooring, curtain pole, light fitting <br>En-suite (8.86ft x 6.56ft) Beautiful vintage floor tiles, hand wash basin, WC, shower unit, light fitting <br>Bedroom 2 (10.83ft x 11.15ft) Double Bedroom with wood effect flooring, curtain pole, curtains, light fitting<br>Bedroom 3 (10.50ft x 6.56ft) Large Single Bedroom - Carpet flooring, venetian blind, curtain pole, light fittings <br>Main Bathroom (6.56ft x 6.56ft) Beautiful bathroom with contemporary tiling and fittings - very impressive quadrant shower, hand wash basin, WC, venetian blind, light fitting <br>Landing (10.50ft x 6.23ft) Carpet flooring, window, access to attic, light fitting "
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Fine, Spacious Three Bedroom Semi Detached Home\nNew Condensor Oil Boiler for Optimum Energy Efficiency\nB Rated Property - Green Mortgage Rates!\nLarge Garden to Rear\nOff Street Parking with Long Driveway to Front\nQuiet and Sought After Area within the Development \n\n"
      },
